    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Budget utilization",
      "description": "Known session spend divided by the configured USD cap. The exporter omits this series unless budget.enabled is true and budget.ratio is a finite nonnegative number. The value may exceed 1. Yellow starts at 0.8 and red at 1, matching the board default. This is panel color, not an installed alert rule. The number is an estimate, not an invoice.",
